# NORTHSTREAM - Optimal tier
#
# Recommended hardware for this tier:
#   RAM:    32 GB+
#   CPU:    8+ cores / vCPUs
#   VRAM:   8+ GB for granite4:3b, 12+ GB for granite4:7b-a1b-h
#   GPU:    e.g. NVIDIA RTX 3070/4060 Ti (8-12 GB), RTX 4070/4080/5080 (12-16 GB),
#           RTX 4090 (24 GB) - any of these comfortably fits either model below
#
# Use together with examples/optimal/.wslconfig (Windows/WSL2) for consistent
# resource limits.
#
# With a GPU, start the stack with GPU passthrough enabled:
#   .\start-addon.ps1 -Gpu      (Windows)
#   ./start-addon.sh --gpu      (Linux/macOS)
#
# Copy this file to the repository root as ".env" (docker compose loads it
# automatically) to select the models used by the Stream Context Agent.
#
# Swap OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL for granite4:7b-a1b-h if your GPU has more headroom.
OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL=granite4:3b
OLLAMA_EMBED_MODEL=granite-embedding:278m
